    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d45">

                <pb facs="0055" n="35" sameAs="frus:frus1864p3/pg35"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Dayton</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 478.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-02-10"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 10, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my communication of the 8th
                    instant, No. 472, respecting the imprisonment of J. H. Mansfield, esq., consul
                    of the United States at Tabasco, I now enclose a copy of a despatch, of the 24th
                    of November last, from him upon the subject.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">William L. Dayton</hi> Esq., <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
